たします。\n\n\n***************************************************************\n\nもしも「依頼を受けて頂ける」場合は、\n「クリエイターガイドライン」にも「赤」で記載されている様に\n\n●『描く前に「必ず依頼をご承認」ください』\n\n●描く前に『ご承認をして頂かないとお仕事の対価が確保されません』。\n\n　●「依頼を承認しないまま」描いてしまいますと\n　　「途中で依頼をクライアントによってキャンセル」された場合、\n　　　●「あなたのお仕事が完全に無駄」になりますのでご注意願います。\n\n宜しくお願いいたします。\n\n以上", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 598639, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "かむら🧦", "screen_name": "kamuraaa_615", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2092559607063511040/nHD0zyZU.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1261571935596449793/1788701472/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 1316761, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "山浦環(絵垢)@skeb募集中", "screen_name": "yamauraillust", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1382712375384576003/4Fp-G1-d.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1382712164662665221/1618499307/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 14, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 2028028, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "南川ろた＠skeb募集中", "screen_name": "nankawarota3", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2013868774051483649/I812PGm3.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1330960168696221696/1